@prefix epr: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/external-paradigm-recompilation#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

# Qualification-only external fact identity. The canonical disposition
# concepts are owned by external-paradigm-recompilation-pack, whose
# ontology.ttl types each of them skos:Concept. This fixture restates only
# that typed identity so the ahr:disposition references resolve when
# agent-harness-recompilation-pack is qualified in isolation
# (cross-pack lint law; SLP-QUAL-001 precedent, standing-ladder-pack).
# It asserts nothing about disposition semantics and grants no standing.

epr:VENDOR a skos:Concept .
epr:WRAP a skos:Concept .
epr:REPLACE a skos:Concept .
